				<li><a href="http://www.dnr.wa.gov/programs-and-services/geology/geologic-hazards/geologic-hazard-maps#tsunami-inundation" target="_blank">Inundation Maps</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.dnr.wa.gov/mobilegeology#get-the-app" target="blank">Evacuation and Inundation Maps Apps</a></li>
			</ul>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>
